ntially go over  the history of a character in a quick  and comedic way i've always liked to  have a fast-paced comedic edge to the  stories i tell and i like to be able to  poke fun at the things that i love  while also telling you why i love them  and that's where this series came to be  it'll be a bi-weekly series airing every  other sunday and the first episode will  be spider-man explained badly airing  this sunday september 4th and honestly i  hope you like it this is something i've  been wanting to make for a very long  time and the fact that rob and everyone  has been  incredibly supportive of me with making  this i'm so excited to put these out i  have been having so much fun in the  writer's room just sitting down either  by myself or with my co-editor jacob  and us just kind of sitting down and  getting to be able to like workshop some  stuff together  and  oh my god i i legitimately love what i'm  doing with this  and  i hope that you all love it too honestly  but feel free to drop your thoughts in a  comment below and i hope you check  everything out this sunday september 4th  and as for the editorials i've been  doing i'll have a little more to say i  think once we get a little closer to  october  because there's a lot of good anime  coming out in october oh my god have you  seen chainsaw man god damn  but yeah that's it for me if you like  what we do feel free to drop a like  subscribe and leave a comment below and  if you like me you can find my twitch  twitter and youtube at red muffler mad  and uh yeah  have a good one everybody  take it easy
 

